```
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Build artifacts
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# Logs
*.log

# Data files that might be temporary
*.csv
*.json
*.parquet

# Coverage reports
coverage/
htmlcov/

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Artifacts directory
artifacts/

# Data snapshots
data/raw_snapshots/*.meta.json
data/raw_snapshots/*.parquet

# Temporary run logs
**/run_log.txt

# Lock files for counters
**/trial_counter.json.lock
**/test_lock.json

```